--TEST--
A `readonly` property has no `get` or `set` hook, as in PHP 8.4 (`rule:classes/property-hooks`)
--FILE--
<?nvs
// A hook runs code on every read, so the property is not one fixed value.
class Price {
    public readonly int $cents {
        get => $this->cents * 100;
    }

    public function constructor(int $cents) {
        $this->cents = $cents;
    }
}
// covers: lang:classes/properties
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0843]: a `readonly` property cannot have a `get` or `set` hook
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
